`enterSelect`:
- Build showcase.
- app.scene=showcase.scene; app.camera=showcase.camera.
- app.state='select'; ui.showSelect; audio.setMood('lobby')? Use 'title'. Maybe 'lobby' for calmer. Use 'lobby'.
- Build cards again maybe selected.
