const rgb = `${Math.round(c.r*255)},...`;
grad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(${rgb},0.42)`);
...
```
Bottom floor gradient.

Also add a radial spotlight? fine.

Add floor disc at y=-0.02, radius 2.2, color dark, to catch shadow. But background may show. Use MeshStandardMaterial color #1a1f2b. It will look like a dark floor. Add ring glow with class color using MeshBasicMaterial transparent. But we can add ring per class, update material color. Good.

Maybe add `scene.fog`? no.

Lights: hemi intensity 1.2, key DirectionalLight color class at intensity 2.5 position (2,4,3) castShadow, fill point at (-2,2,2) class color, rim point at (0,2,-2) white. Shadow map 512. Hero models cast shadows. Ground receives.

Vendor: vendor and dog cast. Background warm.

Map diorama: buildMapDiorama returns scene with camera, lights. Set camera.aspect = 480/300; camera.updateProjectionMatrix(); render. Since buildMapDiorama scene camera at (0.5,3,7.2). Good.

